  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ocean Acidification - proof of concept of new research strategies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to advance in the quantification of the impact of ocean acidification (OA) on marine life and ecosystem functioning.
The overall objective is to help scientists and policymakers in improving the understanding of and knowledge about the changing ocean carbon cycle and its impact. Outreach and communication activities will increase the dissemination of obtained results, providing ample opportunities to increase the insight of policymakers in ocean carbon research and the awareness to continue the support of  the importance of the improved knowledge on impacts of  ocean acidification specifically, to develop locally and regionally relevant adaptation and mitigation strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
